{{!
    @template mod_booking/slotbooking/slot_selection_summary

    Summary of the slots the user has currently selected but not yet booked, rendered below the
    calendar in the fixed-grid booking interface (booking_interface = calendar).

    It exists because that interface's day timeline only ever draws ONE day: with
    max_slots_per_user above 1 the selection legitimately spans several days, so without this list
    a slot picked on another day is invisible and can only be found by navigating back to the right
    day by hand. Each row therefore both names its day and can navigate to it.

    Rendered by condition/slotBooking.js, which also owns the click handling - this template only
    renders markup. It is never rendered with an empty rows array; the caller hides the whole
    region instead.

    Both buttons MUST stay type="button": this markup lives inside the slotbooking mform, where a
    default-type button would submit the booking form.

    The remove button carries core's icon-no-margin helper: core styles every .icon with
    "margin: 0 .5rem 0 0" (theme/boost/scss/moodle/icons.scss), which on an icon-only button offsets
    the glyph to the left of centre instead of sitting in the middle of it.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * heading - Translated heading, e.g. "Selected slots".
    * countlabel - Translated "<n> of <max> selected" label (built caller-side so the placeholders
      are resolved through get_string with an object parameter).
    * showtotal - Whether to render the total row (true only when the option uses prices).
    * totalformatted - Formatted running total, e.g. "90.00 EUR". Only used when showtotal.
    * rows - The selected slots, in selection order.
        * key - Slot key in the form "start:end". Read back by the remove handler.
        * daykey - "YYYY-MM-DD" day key AS PRODUCED BY THE PICKER (slotCalendarPicker's
          findDayKeyForSlotKey), used by the jump handler. Deliberately not the server DTO's own
          "daykey" field, which is not zero-padded.
        * daylabel - Human readable day, e.g. "Wed, 2 September 2026".
        * timelabel - Human readable time range, e.g. "09:30 - 10:00".
        * priceformatted - Formatted price for this slot, empty when no price applies.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "heading": "Selected slots",
        "countlabel": "2 of 3 selected",
        "showtotal": true,
        "totalformatted": "90.00 EUR",
        "rows": [
            {"key": "1788357600:1788359400", "daykey": "2026-09-02", "daylabel": "Wed, 2 September 2026", "timelabel": "09:30 - 10:00", "priceformatted": "45.00 EUR"},
            {"key": "1788530400:1788532200", "daykey": "2026-09-04", "daylabel": "Fri, 4 September 2026", "timelabel": "10:00 - 10:30", "priceformatted": "45.00 EUR"}
        ]
    }
}}
<div class="booking-slot-selection-summary border rounded p-2 mt-3">
    <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center flex-wrap gap-2 mb-1">
        <span class="fw-bold">{{heading}}</span>
        <span class="small text-muted">{{countlabel}}</span>
    </div>
    <ul class="list-unstyled mb-0">
        {{#rows}}
            <li class="booking-slot-selection-summary-row d-flex align-items-center flex-wrap gap-2 py-1 border-top"
                data-slot-key="{{key}}" data-day-key="{{daykey}}">
                <button type="button"
                        class="btn btn-link p-0 text-start flex-grow-1 booking-slot-selection-summary-jump"
                        data-action="goto-day"
                        title="{{#str}}slot_selection_gotoday, mod_booking{{/str}}">
                    <span class="booking-slot-selection-summary-day">{{daylabel}}</span>
                    <span class="booking-slot-selection-summary-time">{{timelabel}}</span>
                </button>
                {{#priceformatted}}
                    <span class="small text-muted booking-slot-selection-summary-price">{{priceformatted}}</span>
                {{/priceformatted}}
                <button type="button"
                        class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-danger icon-no-margin booking-slot-selection-summary-remove"
                        data-action="remove-slot"
                        aria-label="{{#str}}slot_selection_remove, mod_booking{{/str}}"
                        title="{{#str}}slot_selection_remove, mod_booking{{/str}}">
                    {{#pix}}t/delete, core{{/pix}}
                </button>
            </li>
        {{/rows}}
    </ul>
    {{#showtotal}}
        <div class="d-flex justify-content-end align-items-center gap-2 border-top pt-1 mt-1">
            <span class="small">{{#str}}slot_selection_total, mod_booking{{/str}}</span>
            <span class="fw-bold booking-slot-selection-summary-total">{{totalformatted}}</span>
        </div>
    {{/showtotal}}
</div>